                        "help": "Template ID, e.g. tpl_XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX."
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "variables",
                        "type": "collection",
                        "label": "Variables",
                        "spec": [],
                        "help": "Template variable values, keyed by variable name (use a JSON object)."
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "label": "Project JSON",
                "value": "json",
                "nested": [
                    {
                        "name": "projectJson",
                        "type": "any",
                        "label": "Project JSON",
                        "required": true,
                        "help": "Full Zvid project spec (scenes, elements, output settings). Elements go in `visuals` with type IMAGE, VIDEO, GIF, SVG or TEXT; soundtracks in `audios`; captions in `subtitle`. Layout tips for AI-generated JSON: use `scenes` for sequential messages; `position` presets ignore x/y (use position 'custom' for offsets); put headline + subline inside one TEXT element's html; build cards as one flex-centered TEXT element. Run the payload through 'Validate a Render Payload' first to catch problems for free — it returns field-level errors and your plan limits."
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
    {
